+    """NEAR: whether `VLLM_CONFIDENTIAL_COMPUTE_KEEP_UVA=1` keeps the V2 runner's
+    UVA buffers although Confidential Computing is on. Under CC the device view
+    of pinned host memory is not coherent (the GPU reads a stale snapshot), so
+    this is only valid on bare metal. `VLLM_NEAR_DISABLE_UVA=1` still wins."""
